    "detailed_description": "Bishojo Battlefield is the first battlefield experience mobile game developed by our studio. The ultimate audio-visual experience, various maps, real ballistics, cool blasts, and perfect shooting feel will bring you a different shooting experience. In order to seize more battlefield in the game, you need to learn to shoot, but also learn to ride a horse and shoot arrows, drive a tank, wield a sword and dance a spear, and confront the enemy through superior combat strategy and agile operation to win the war. The game features a: ancient and modern confrontation, you can experience the peak of cold weapons and hot weapons duel; feature two: sandbox mode, the game play self-set; feature three: 100 people battlefield, secondary moe girls, knights, archers, special forces and other characters to fight alongside or against you. Feature four: weapon diversification, each weapon can be unique. If you like our game, hurry up and download the trial game ~",
